def check_3346():
    'Best-fit beta E(a) in the supernova distances: minimum of the committed full-covariance Delta chi2(beta) profile (Pantheon+SH0ES, 1590 SNe, Omega_m 0.315, offset marginalised). Book line 117, printed -0.035.'
