    "eq:base times T_dS/T_H, with T_dS from H_dS = c sqrt(Lambda/3) and Lambda = 3 Omega_L H0^2/c^2, evaluated with the book's Planck 2018 inputs (value printed at line 205) (Eq. eq:corr). Book line 201, printed 1.142\\times10^{-123}."
    Hv=Hsi(67.4); lHv=c/Hv; OLv=0.6847; Obv=0.0493  # Planck 2018 values used by the book (p1_02:739)
    Lamv=3*OLv*Hv**2/c**2; HdS=c*math.sqrt(Lamv/3)  # de Sitter rate from Lambda alone
    value=(2/math.pi)*(lP/lHv)**2*(HdS/Hv)*(Obv/Om)
    return locals()

